# Job budgets, one raise per line with its reason; helpers/job_budget.py refuses a bare raise.
# The default is 20 minutes. scaffold/ ships this same file to callers, so adopting the template
# adopts these budgets too; a caller may raise one further, with a reason, in its own copy.
falsify 30 Kani install plus the replay of every falsification patch
drift 30 two channels, stable and beta, each building, testing and linting
msrv 30 installs the manifest's rust-version and builds and tests at it
semver 30 cargo-semver-checks builds the crate against its last release
miri 60 Miri is an order of magnitude slower than the tests it runs
mutation 60 cargo-mutants builds one test binary per mutant, two at a time
fuzz 30 five minutes per fuzz target plus the nightly toolchain
publish 30 cargo publish --dry-run, then the crates.io publish itself
